IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-NGRAM-REP-DECAY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HISTORY-LEN         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NGRAM-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NGRAMS-EVAL         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BASE-PENALTY        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-NGRAM-DECAY.
    IF HISTORY-LEN == 0 OR NGRAM-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE HISTORY-LEN TO NGRAMS-EVAL.
    SUBTRACT NGRAM-SIZE FROM NGRAMS-EVAL.
    ADD 1 TO NGRAMS-EVAL.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NGRAMS-EVAL.
    WEIGHT 30 NGRAM-SIZE.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
